SUMMARY:Summer Cool down Hi-Wire Brewing RAD
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nHey Nomads! Its been a rather hot summer\,
  so lets cool down together with some delicious frosty beers from one of o
 ur favorite venues\, Hi-Wire Rad!\n\nCome out and join with interesting an
 d engaging fellow remote workers in the very cool beer garden. There are f
 un games and activities that are provided inside the brewery as well.\n\nW
 ith the weather being unpredictable this time of year\, we decided to keep
  our celebration outdoors with an indoor option. Whatever the weather happ
 ens to be\, or whatever is holding you back from coming out\, push through
  and come out anyway to socialize with your favorite remote workers and fr
 iends.\n\nThey have expanded their parking capacity and now have 2 large l
 ots\, so parking shouldn’t be a problem\n\nIf you come hungry\, there is
  always a food truck there to provide us with tasty grub!!\n\nLook for our
  AVLDN signage and group of friendly faces and fill out a name tag to ease
  introductions.\n\nSee you there!
