SUMMARY:Guided Masterclass: The Modern Remote Job Hunt
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Ditch the spray-and-pray. Build a search
  process that actually works.**\nLet's be honest. The remote job hunt in 2
 026 is broken. Ghost listings that were never real. AI gatekeepers screeni
 ng you out before a human ever sees your name. A hundred applicants for ev
 ery "flexible" role that isn't secretly a scam. If you feel like you're sh
 outing into a void\, you're not imagining it.\n\nYou don't need more job b
 oards. You need a system.\n\nJoin Michelle Coulson ([Remote Rebellion](htt
 ps://www.remoterebellion.com/))\, Jim Coughlin ([Remotivated](http://remot
 ivated.com))\, and host Ric Pratte for a guided masterclass that will chan
 ge how you search for good. This isn't generic advice about tweaking your 
 resume font. It's the real playbook: how to get referred into private netw
 orks before roles ever go public\, how to use AI as your edge instead of y
 our enemy\, and how to stop wasting energy on jobs you don't even want.\n\
 n**This is a companion on the Thrive Remotely 7/23 newsletter [🚀 Your R
 emote Job Hunt\, Fixed 🚀 ](https://news.thriveremotely.io/p/your-remote
 -job-hunt-fixed)**\n\n**The virtual event is managed on the Thrive Remotel
 y site\, You’ll need to [register here](https://news.thriveremotely.io/p
 roducts/guided-masterclass-the-modern-remote-job-hunt). The session fee is
  $29.**\n\nYou'll learn to build visibility where hiring managers actually
  look. Target smarter instead of applying wider. Turn your experience into
  tangible proof\, not just promises on a page. And yes\, we'll talk about 
 the emotional toll too\, because this is a marathon\, and burning out half
 way through helps no one.\n\nCome skeptical. Leave with a system you'll ac
 tually use\, real connections in the right rooms\, and a genuine shot at t
 he role that funds the life you're building.\n\n#### Job Seekers Toolkit\n
 \nIncluded in your registration are two valuable tools to transform your r
 emote job search.\n\nThe [Thrive Remotely Job Tracker](https://news.thrive
 remotely.io/products/standalone-remote-job-tracker) transforms the chaotic
  remote job search into a structured\, data-backed campaign that moves you
  from anxious applicant to a professional in control of your career. By le
 veraging built-in tools like the Timezone Alignment Engine and ATS Keyword
  Log\, it helps you identify compatible roles and optimize your applicatio
 ns to significantly increase your hiring potential.\n\nThe [Remote-First R
 esume Blueprint](https://news.thriveremotely.io/products/ats-proof-remote-
 first-resume-blueprint) is engineered to help you bypass automated Applica
 nt Tracking Systems that often reject visually complex resumes. By removin
 g digital clutter\, this layout ensures your application lands directly in
  front of recruiters while highlighting the specific asynchronous skills a
 nd remote tools that hiring managers are looking for.
