SUMMARY:AI Hacks & Hops: Go From Idea to Five-Client Pilot in Six Weeks
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Building Naked:** *How a Nontechnical Fo
 under Used AI to Go From Idea to Five-Client Pilot in Six Weeks*\n**Speake
 r:** [Shellie Sullivan](https://www.linkedin.com/in/shelliesullivan/)\n\n*
 *Description:**\nWhat can one experienced\, nontechnical founder build in 
 six weeks when AI gives her access to capabilities that once required an e
 ntire founding team and a significant initial investment?\n\nIn this candi
 d case study\, Shellie Sullivan will share how she used AI to turn one con
 versation with a friend into Naked Life\, an emerging proprietary dating m
 ethodology\, and a complete client experience tested with five pilot clien
 ts.\n\nWorking with AI as an always-available strategy and execution partn
 er allowed her to research the market\, interrogate her assumptions\, deve
 lop and connect complex ideas\, shape the brand\, design the client journe
 y\, create operating systems\, document intellectual property\, and learn 
 from real client experiences at extraordinary speed.\nShellie will take th
 e audience inside the actual process\, including what AI did exceptionally
  well\, where it got things wrong\, and what still required human observat
 ion\, judgment\, taste\, ethics\, and decision-making.\n\nThis is not a co
 ding session or a collection of clever prompts. It is a transparent look a
 t how an entrepreneur can use AI to access multidisciplinary thinking\, de
 epen an idea\, and move from insight to a sophisticated\, testable busines
 s without waiting to assemble a large team.\n\nThe business is not yet pro
 ven or scaled. That is precisely what makes the story useful: attendees wi
 ll see the real experiment while it is unfolding\, including the evidence\
 , unanswered questions\, early client learning\, and next tests.\n\nThe ce
 ntral question is not whether AI can build a business for you. It is what 
 you could build if AI helped you fully activate what you already know.\n\n
 **Special discount on ADN engraved Pirani cups!**\nYour paid ticket gets y
 ou $10 off our 5th anniversary with our customized [ADN Pirani cups](https
 ://avldigitalnomads.org/meet-our-brand-new-customized-adn-pirani-mugs/)! A
 vailable in 16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz sizes\, you can select yours directly a
 t this event.\n\n**General Event Info**\nAI Hacks and Hops is a monthly ev
 ent tailored for non-technical professionals\, entrepreneurs\, marketers\,
  engineers\, or anyone who wants to explore and discuss how to use AI.\n\n
 Each gathering will feature presentations\, stimulating group discussions\
 , and a relaxed atmosphere for enjoying your favorite brews while delving 
 into the world of AI. Topics will range from AI integration in business pr
 ocesses\, marketing\, content creation\, software\, ethical considerations
 \, human-AI collaboration strategies\, to the latest advancements in AI te
 chnology. The informal setting encourages open dialogue\, idea exchange\, 
 and fosters a collaborative spirit.
