SUMMARY:Leadership on Tap
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nRemote work didn't create new challenges
 —it revealed existing habits\, standards\, and behaviors. When supervisi
 on decreases and independence increases\, the choices we make each day bec
 ome more visible in our outcomes. Drawing from experiences on a farm\, at 
 Ohio State\, in the NFL\, in business\, and even in a garden\, Chuck Hutch
 ison explores why people with similar talent and opportunities often produ
 ce very different results. This presentation examines the standards\, beha
 viors\, and responses that consistently shape performance\, trust\, and be
 tter outcomes—regardless of where we work.\n\n**Special discount on ADN 
 engraved Pirani cups!**\n**Your paid ticket gets you $10 off our 5th-anniv
 ersary custom [ADN Pirani cups](https://avldigitalnomads.org/meet-our-bran
 d-new-customized-adn-pirani-mugs/)! Available in 16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz si
 zes\, you can select yours directly at this event.**\n\nEveryone! Whether 
 you're leading in for-profit\, non-profit\, academia\, community organizat
 ions\, or entrepreneurship – or simply curious about leadership – you'
 re welcome to join us.\n\n* Hatch Coworking\n* Parking: Street parking is 
 free after 6 pm\n* Beverages: Alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages
